# HY300 T08 -- one board, two stock firmwares. Described from a stock OTA image (2024-04-19) and,
# since 01.11.2026, from its first owner's eMMC dump (issue #7, GitHub `smj-0712`: an older boot
# package of 2023-11 under a newer Android 11 userland). Nobody here has the board; nothing of ours
# has run on it. The variants carry the two firmwares (variants/<name>/variant.env, read after
# this file, its keys win); release/build-all.sh needs --variant for this board.
BOARD_ID=hy300-t08
VARIANTS="ota20240419 unit202311"
# The board as a whole: no owner has reported a run of ours. A TEST image for the owner of issue #7
# is the only build (--test-image; doku/121 section 5).
STATUS=profile-only
VERIFIED_BY=
PROFILE=hy300_t08
IMAGE_NAME=h713-hy300-t08
# kernel patch 0349: the HY300 Pro's tree with the "ADT-3 2024" firmware's two values (elog, AFBD
# handoff) from the HY320; no keyboard node (the case has the power button only, owner 03.11.2026).
# Built with dtc, never booted.
KERNEL_DTB=sun50i-h713-hy300-t08
# U-Boot base hy300_t08_defconfig (fork branch, 03.11.2026): hy300_pro_defconfig with this board's
# DRAM block at 640 MHz, its tree and its identification string. uboot.config beside this file keeps
# the same block for a probe build.
UBOOT_BOARD=hy300_t08
# Optional hardware: nothing measured. The owner's stock tree names a focus motor (the HY300 Pro's
# tables) and an accelerometer node; the case has one button, no remote came with the unit.
FEATURES=
# the name in the network (TODO 5.18)
HOSTNAME_BOARD=hy300t08
